FIX CHAMPIONSHIP season-end crash (833): Reset_League_Info uninitialized aiStack_5c

2026-10-03 correction: the original reset writes WORD points @0x93def0, not
league @0x93def2. With a valid standings permutation all sorting slots are
filled. Patch 852 identifies the real corrupting predecessor: the port's
merged transfer counter relegated car index 20 and left duplicate/missing
league ranks. It restores that transfer and removes this artificial zero-fill.
The original-stack-garbage attribution below is disproved; retained as history.

The final QA-loop finding: completing a full 5-race Championship season crashed the browser
renderer (silent page crash, no WASM RuntimeError; reliable). Instrumentation was a heisenbug
(printf changed the layout and hid it) -- a layout-sensitive memory corruption. Traced (SEDBG
entry-logging) to Do_End_Of_Season_Stuff -> Reset_League_Info -> FUN_0044c9c0. Root: the real
Reset_League_Info @0x44c498 falls through into the standings sort, but its reset loop first zeros
the league words, so the fall-through fill collides all 20 cars into league 0 and leaves
aiStack_5c[5..19] UNINITIALIZED; FUN_0044c9c0's final loop then reads those garbage ints as car
indices and writes `*(short*)(0x93def4 + ((num_cars-1) - (garbage&0x1f))*0x36)` -- a negative,
out-of-bounds offset -> wild write -> crash. The asm write is faithful (same OOB in the original)
-- this is the "deterministic uninitialized stack read" class (patch-685 family): the original
relied on benign x86 stack garbage, which the rebuild's stack layout doesn't reproduce. Fixed by
initializing aiStack_5c[20]=0 before the fill (empty-league slots -> car 0 -> in-bounds write; the
reset standings are placeholder, repopulated by the new season). FUN_0044c9c0 (shared with
Sort_Leagues, which fills all 20 slots with real data) is untouched.

Browser-verified: full 5-race season now completes past race 5 to the season-end screen (scr137)
with no crash (was reliably page-crashed). verify + verify-wasm 10/10 both; L9 702/702
bit-identical (championship-only path, not in the attract).
